{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"兩二手名牌店疑欠客人3800萬寄賣款項　逾210人報案\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FRAUD-BAG-261118-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】兩間二手名牌店疑拖欠客人約3800萬元寄賣款項，警方接逾210人報案。</p><p>其中一間涉事店舖位於銅鑼灣羅素街，截至傍晚6時，警方接獲140名市民報案，懷疑店舖拖欠約2650萬元寄賣款項。</p><p>警方亦接獲76名市民報案，稱金鐘海富中心一間二手名牌店懷疑拖欠共約1150萬元寄賣款項。案件暫列欺詐，由灣仔及中區重案組跟進。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.384624+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:40:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:52:15.928770+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:33.245340+00:00","content_hash":"77618971d00a23dcb4c31e594b01ce2bab4ae51958f409852bf9ed509ca7303a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.384624+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}